{"mode":"words","text":"Mulai dari sini, tujuan belajarmu yang menentukan. Jika kamu hanya ingin memahami bahasa tersebut, kamu sudah mencapai tujuanmu — cukup lanjutkan ke langkah dua dan tiga. Jika kamu ingin berbicara, inilah saatnya berlatih berbicara secara serempak: Pilih kalimat pendek dengan metode pengulangan A-B, atur kecepatan sangat lambat, dan ucapkan bersamaan dengan suara yang diputar — seperti bernyanyi dalam paduan suara. Kamu akan langsung mendengar jika ada yang terdengar berbeda, dan secara otomatis akan mengoreksinya sendiri. Cara ini bisa dilakukan di mana saja, bahkan di dalam trem: dengan menggunakan headphone, suaranya akan terdengar seperti sedang menelepon. Dan jika kamu ingin belajar menulis, cukup tuliskan teks tersebut kalimat demi kalimat.","words":[{"s":0,"e":313},{"s":372,"e":569},{"s":615,"e":1184},{"s":1428,"e":1788},{"s":1846,"e":2299},{"s":2334,"e":2450},{"s":2496,"e":3309},{"s":3750,"e":4005},{"s":4063,"e":4284},{"s":4319,"e":4563},{"s":4609,"e":4818},{"s":4865,"e":5364},{"s":5422,"e":5770},{"s":5828,"e":6583},{"s":6827,"e":7082},{"s":7117,"e":7384},{"s":7407,"e":7814},{"s":7848,"e":8499},{"s":8615,"e":8824},{"s":9067,"e":9346},{"s":9404,"e":9845},{"s":9915,"e":9984},{"s":10031,"e":10309},{"s":10367,"e":10588},{"s":10646,"e":10774},{"s":10832,"e":11389},{"s":11668,"e":11923},{"s":11970,"e":12190},{"s":12225,"e":12399},{"s":12446,"e":13282},{"s":13456,"e":13874},{"s":13897,"e":14303},{"s":14350,"e":14756},{"s":14779,"e":15290},{"s":15348,"e":15650},{"s":15696,"e":16405},{"s":16846,"e":17241},{"s":17275,"e":17670},{"s":17717,"e":18076},{"s":18135,"e":18355},{"s":18413,"e":18808},{"s":18866,"e":19388},{"s":19470,"e":20015},{"s":20294,"e":20573},{"s":20619,"e":21188},{"s":21234,"e":21478},{"s":21536,"e":22105},{"s":22314,"e":22453},{"s":22535,"e":23069},{"s":23127,"e":23696},{"s":23742,"e":23974},{"s":24032,"e":24381},{"s":24427,"e":24543},{"s":24578,"e":25077},{"s":25228,"e":25437},{"s":25611,"e":26029},{"s":26076,"e":26529},{"s":2